'Ranjit Dutta writes poetry and fiction in Assamese and English and works across languages as a translator. His Assamese lyric collection Xur eti Deana was launched in Margherita in 2019. His collaborations with Rajorshi Patranabis include translation between Assamese and Bengali and the rendering of Assamese poetry into English.',
